Z||000006||JSocha||06-13-2001||10:35 AM||||I'm back...computer was acting goofy so I though I better save cause remembering the count, language and trying to spell them is tough enough as it is, especially when I am out of practice.<P>Anyways, conclusion:  Must be the english language!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Like Gallahger once asked, "Why do they call them buildings when they are already built?  Why don't they call them 'builts'?"<P>"Why do they call it raizing a building when they are tearing it down?"<P>Ever see Gallagers show and speach on the English language ... from being easy to being extremly hard?<P>Home...H-O-M-E.<BR>Pome...P-O-M-E?  No...P-O-E-M!<P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
